@startuml
' Teoz's anchors and durations: `{start}` names a message's height, and
' `{start} <-> {end} : words` shows how long it takes between two, at the
' middle of the first, taking no room of its own; across a page break
' it is drawn in a piece on each page.
!pragma teoz true
{call} Client -> Server : request for the order list
Server -> Store : read
Store --> Server : rows
{reply} Server --> Client : list
{call} <-> {reply} : 120 ms
{sent} Client -> Server : upload
newpage
{done} Server --> Client : stored
{sent} <-> {done} : over a page
@enduml
